Step 1. Build the master HABS-HD dataset

Scriptbuild/build_habshd_master_dataset.qmd

PurposeCreates the canonical merged HABS-HD dataset by combining:

genotype sample IDs from the FAM file

ancestry / population similarity and PCs

clinical variables

genomics variables including APOE4

medication variables

PRS score files from selected trait folders

biomarker data

Key helper codeR/habshd_master_data.R

Primary outputshared_data/habshd_master_df.rds

InterpretationThis is the single source-of-truth cohort object for downstream HABS-HD PRS analyses.

